# Our own back dash (step 6 of the melee port, reports/Свои анимации для боя.md): the hero with a one-hander drawn
# (talent 2, so the HUMANS_1HST2 overlay and its S_1HRUN stance) plays three finished dash candidates from content,
# then the original T_1HPARADEJUMPB; side and front at 1x, side slowed 4x. On the flat floor of Xardas' tower.
# The candidates come from OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT made by scripts/content/anim/content_pack.py (T_1HDASHB_1.._3 in
# HUMANS_1HST2.MSB). The look is judged by Claude from the clips; anim_pop in metrics.csv at the switches.
# WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=/abs/content
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
release all
overlay off
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_IN1_26
wait 800
watch player
melee-shadow weapon 1h
# the talent set by the fixture does not put its stance overlay on; bladepath puts it on (no names after it)
bladepath HUMANS_1HST2.MDS
wait 1500
anims
animinfo T_1HDASHB_1 T_1HDASHB_2 T_1HPARADEJUMPB S_1HRUN

cam follow 420 100 90
wait 800
rec dash-side
ani player T_1HDASHB_1
wait 1400
ani player T_1HDASHB_2
wait 1400
ani player T_1HDASHB_3
wait 1400
ani player T_1HPARADEJUMPB
wait 1400
stop

cam follow 420 100 0
wait 800
rec dash-front
ani player T_1HDASHB_1
wait 1400
ani player T_1HDASHB_2
wait 1400
ani player T_1HDASHB_3
wait 1400
stop

cam follow 380 100 90
slowmo 4
wait 800
rec dash-slow-side
ani player T_1HDASHB_1
wait 1200
ani player T_1HDASHB_2
wait 1200
ani player T_1HDASHB_3
wait 1200
ani player T_1HPARADEJUMPB
wait 1200
stop
slowmo 1
